+/**
+ * dshui patch: the VS Code workspace of the window the open click happens in,
+ * published by the dshui host plugin as `window.__DSHUI_WORKSPACE__` (with a
+ * fallback to the boot URL's `dshui_workspace` query parameter). Attached to
+ * `openSettingsDocument` as `dshuiOrigin` so the Host opens the settings
+ * document in this window even when its path is owned by no workspace.
+ * @returns the scope path, or undefined when neither source is set.
+ */
+function dshuiClickOrigin(): string | undefined {
